GET {{apiUrl}}/htes

Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Expected:
### HTTP 401


###############################################################
# AUTHORIZATION - STUDENT
###############################################################

### Student Cannot List HTE Profiles
GET {{apiUrl}}/htes
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


### Student Cannot Get HTE Students
GET {{apiUrl}}/htes/{{hteId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


### Student Cannot Get My HTE Students
GET {{apiUrl}}/htes/my/students
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


### Student Cannot Create HTE
POST {{apiUrl}}/htes
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Unauthorized Student HTE",
  "address": "Test Address",
  "contactPerson": "Test Person",
  "contactEmail": "student@example.com",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567"
}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


