###############################################################
# AUTHORIZATION - HTE SUPERVISOR
###############################################################

### HTE Supervisor Cannot List All HTE Profiles
GET {{apiUrl}}/htes
Authorization: Bearer {{hteSupervisorToken}}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


### HTE Supervisor Cannot Create HTE
POST {{apiUrl}}/htes
Authorization: Bearer {{hteSupervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Unauthorized Supervisor HTE",
  "address": "Test Address",
  "contactPerson": "Test Person",
  "contactEmail": "supervisor@example.com",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567"
}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


### HTE Supervisor Cannot Update HTE
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/htes/{{hteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hteSupervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Unauthorized Supervisor Update"
}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


### HTE Supervisor Cannot Change HTE Status
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/htes/{{hteId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{hteSupervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Expected:
### HTTP 403


### HTE Supervisor Can Access Own Students
GET {{apiUrl}}/htes/my/students
Authorization: Bearer {{hteSupervisorToken}}

### Expected:
### HTTP 200
### success = true
### data = array
### Only students belonging to the supervisor's assigned HTE are returned.



